# Build context for docker/Dockerfile.streaming-test (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside the Dockerfile).  The image needs only
# the package metadata, the sources and its entry point; the tests run
# against the working tree mounted at /src.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/
!docker/streaming-test-entrypoint.sh
**/__pycache__
